  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Read path (the whole app)",
      "items": [
        "GET /api/runs globs RUN_DIR/transcripts/*/transcripts.jsonl, keeps only workflow=coder_generation lines.",
        "GET /api/corpus is a constant: the rubric JSON is read once at module load, not per request.",
        "Client holds all navigation state (runId, selCase, selFile, tab) and refetches on each change via three useEffects.",
        "Runs are grouped by model tag client-side: ~167 attempts collapse to a handful of Selector entries."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Only mutation in the system",
      "items": [
        "POST /api/grades/:runId overwrites the whole GradeMap \u2014 last writer wins, no merge, no locking.",
        "Grades are keyed case:<id> and file:<path>; the frozen rubric is never mutated.",
        "The client optimistically updates local state, so a failed POST silently diverges on reload."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Structural issues worth noting",
      "items": [
        "Every request re-reads and re-parses full JSONL transcripts; runs() globs the directory on each call \u2014 O(runs x lines) per page view.",
        "corpus path is an absolute hard-coded path into /home/xore/Github/APIARY/... \u2014 the server cannot start anywhere else.",
        "No route table: fetch() is a linear if/return chain, so every endpoint re-runs the preceding regex matches.",
        "The Astryx CSS route whitelists /node_modules paths through the exports map; safe today, but it is a hand-rolled static server.",
        "verify.ts is an unrunnable-by-default e2e: it needs the server already listening on :3020 and a Chrome with a debug port."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Deliberate simplifications already flagged",
      "items": [
        "shiki: 6 grammars gated to corpus languages (~200 KB each) \u2014 add an entry when the benchmark emits a new language.",
        "answer-chunks: heuristic codeScore() split, not a parser; buckets mixing C/Python/shell highlight approximately.",
        "langOf(): prefix heuristics default to rust \u2014 documented ponytail: ceiling noted inline in app.tsx."
      ]
    }
  ]
